is","role":"Policewoman","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qBiuPhP3IXJS5c9089reFC1Yc5N.jpg"},{"id":3928371,"name":"Meriam Lounifi","role":"Dog Breeder","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ywCBJqfiatPQH1ahzbO5Gzw6E3R.jpg"},{"id":3569115,"name":"Tyrese Bukenya","role":"Gardener","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oGkjbD6Zz6XHRzycdZcsBU8wsBU.jpg"},{"id":1610654,"name":"Mareile Blendl","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/om2ZMx7cdNdsU1ZOSp9qLixxXfy.jpg"},{"id":1875487,"name":"Priscilla Wittman","role":"Woman with red hat","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/odFdtEerd6EbWwWlNTe2hfgg3CE.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Lassie - Una nuova avventura","overview":"Sono le vacanze estive e Flo, insieme all'inseparabile Lassie, va a trascorrerle in Alto Adige dai nuovi amici Henri, Kleo e la piccola Filippa, un Jack Russell Terrier. Alcuni ladri di cani si aggirano però per il paese e quando anche Filippa scompare Lassie e i tre amici partono in missione per ritrovarla."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Lassie: A New Adventure","overview":"Flo and his trusted Collie pal Lassie spend the summer at Aunt Cosma's, alongside her foster children Kleo and Henry, and her dog Pippa. When local canines start disappearing, including Pippa, Lassie rallies the kids to solve the mystery.","tagline":"The world's favourite dog-tective is back!"},{"language":"de-DE","overview":"Es sind Sommerferien! Aber dieses Jahr lässt sich Flo nicht auf eine Trennung von Lassie ein: Anstatt die Ferien auf Gran Canaria mit den Eltern zu verbringen, werden Flo und Lassie von Haushälter Gerhardt zum Hof von Tante Cosima in Südtirol gebracht, die dort mit Jack Russell Pippa und ihren Pflegekindern Kleo und Henri lebt. Gerhardt verbringt währenddessen die Zeit im nicht weit entfernten Grand Hotel Sternberg und unterstützt dort - weil er im Urlaub machen völlig ungeübt ist - die Hotelbesitzerin Bianca Sternberg."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9KMvu5QstkJyThWb3vhKsDmwmZV.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9utq8PrMyvFBtlte2BDNaj1ktSi.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1088563,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"de-DE","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9KMvu5QstkJyThWb3vhKsDmwmZV.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9KMvu5QstkJyThWb3vhKsDmwmZV.jpg","language":"it","width":994,"height":1491},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9KMvu5QstkJyThWb3vhKsDmwmZV.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9KMvu5QstkJyThWb3vhKsDmwmZV.jpg","language":"it","width":994,"height":1491},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5fjRiQA5osEf8ULu19QFyFyi68g.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5fjRiQA5osEf8ULu19QFyFyi68g.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jGFcaPyEMK25fIs5BSAHrKsi2Q8.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jGFcaPyEMK25fIs5BSAHrKsi2Q8.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jGFcaPyEMK25fIs5BSAHrKsi2Q8.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jGFcaPyEMK25fIs5BSAHrKsi2Q8.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"de":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jh6iI8BP2b4A1ZP44YERvIR6R6Q.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jh6iI8BP2b4A1ZP44YERvIR6R6Q.jpg","language":"de","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jh6iI8BP2b4A1ZP44YERvIR6R6Q.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w3